and intonation and that stuff,

00:26:35.333 --> 00:26:37.770
and basically how
the UI can affect

00:26:37.770 --> 00:26:39.020
how your conversation happens.

00:26:39.020 --> 00:26:39.800
It's super fascinating.

00:26:39.800 --> 00:26:41.508
MELANIE WARRICK:
