if you really,

00:32:20.650 --> 00:32:23.390
really, really, really,
really, really, really, really,

00:32:23.390 --> 00:32:26.150
don't want to use that for
some weird reason or you want

00:32:26.150 --> 00:32:28.340
to set up individual
short-lived tokens just

00:32:28.340 --> 00:32:31.350
