you can do that as well.

00:32:31.350 --> 00:32:33.350
We'll link to it in
the documentation.

00:32:33.350 --> 00:32:35.099
There's an advanced
authentication thing--

00:32:35.099 --> 00:32:37.200
you can still do that
yourself if you need to.

00:32:37.200 --> 00:32:40.190
But generally speaking, use
gcloud auth configure-docker

00:32:40.190 --> 00:32:41.840
and you are good to go.

